          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10" style="position:relative">
            <p class="font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.24em] ja-eyebrow">育てる力</p>
            <h2 class="mt-6 font-display text-3xl leading-[1.3] md:text-5xl">ハタヨガ・瞑想を通して育てたい6つの力</h2>
            <div class="ja-grid3 mt-12 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <div class="sc-card sc-rise" style="background:#FBF8EE;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.32);border-radius:6px;padding:34px 30px 36px">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-icon" style="display:grid;place-items:center;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#E6E9D8;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.4);color:#7E8764;flex:none"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="10.5"/><circle cx="16" cy="16" r="4.5"/><path d="M16 2v4M16 26v4M2 16h4M26 16h4"/></svg></span>
                <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl leading-snug">集中する力</h3>
                <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:34px;height:2px;background:#7E8764;margin:18px 0 16px"></div>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4A3F31">外からの刺激に意識を奪われ続けるのではなく、「今ここ」に意識を戻す力を育てます。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="sc-card sc-rise" style="background:#FBF8EE;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.32);border-radius:6px;padding:34px 30px 36px">
                <span aria-hidden="true" class="sc-icon" style="display:grid;place-items:center;width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;background:#F7E6DC;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.4);color:#C98B67;flex:none"><svg viewBox="0 0 32 32" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 27C9.5 21.5 4.5 17.5 4.5 12.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 1 16 9.4a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 11.5 3.1C27.5 17.5 22.5 21.5 16 27Z"/></svg></span>
                <h3 class="mt-6 font-display text-xl leading-snug">心を整える力</h3>
                <div aria-hidden="true" style="width:34px;height:2px;background:#C98B67;margin:18px 0 16px"></div>
                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color:#4A3F31">感情や思考に振り回されるのではなく、「今、自分はどんな状態なのか」に気づく力を育てます。</p>
              </div>
              <div class="sc-card sc-rise" style="background:#FBF8EE;border:1px solid rgba(138,96,67,.32);border-radius:6px;padding:34px 30px 36px">
